									"#define $WAVE *sine",
									"Instrument Settings / #define   ·   entry 001",
									"VALUES: #define $NAME replacement-text\nSCOPE: preprocessor (outside headers)",
									"Defines a preprocessor substitution; this directive does not use an equals sign.",
									"A $NAME macro must be referenced later in the file; defining it alone changes no sound.",
									"// #define — Instrument Settings\n#define $WAVE *sine\n<region>\nsample=$WAVE lokey=48 hikey=72 pitch_keycenter=60 volume=-18\nampeg_release=0.25\n",
									"Load this SFZ into sfizz~; enable audio; play MIDI note 60 at velocity 100, hold for 2 seconds, then release.",
									"Published support table; not runtime-verified for your Max 9 build.",
									"Instrument Settings / #define   ·   entry 001\nVALUES: #define $NAME replacement-text\nSCOPE: preprocessor (outside headers)\nREQUIRES: A $NAME macro must be referenced later in the file; defining it alone changes no sound.\nTRY: Load this SFZ into sfizz~; enable audio; play MIDI note 60 at velocity 100, hold for 2 seconds, then release.\nBUILD NOTE: Published support table; not runtime-verified for your Max 9 build."
								]
							},
							{
								"key": 2,
								"value": [
									"default_path=samples/",
									"Instrument Settings / default_path   ·   entry 002",
									"VALUES: directory path string\nSCOPE: <control>",
									"In <control>, sets the base directory for sample-file references.",
									"The samples/ folder must exist relative to the SFZ file; put the named sample inside it. Replace every REPLACE_WITH_… filename with a real file path relative to the SFZ.",
									"// default_path — Instrument Settings\n<control>\ndefault_path=samples/\n<region>\nsample=REPLACE_WITH_SAMPLE.wav lokey=48 hikey=72 pitch_keycenter=60\nvolume=-18 ampeg_release=0.25\n",
									"Replace the filename, keep <control> before the region, then play note 60.",
									"Published support table; not runtime-verified for your Max 9 build.",
									"Instrument Settings / default_path   ·   entry 002\nVALUES: directory path string\nSCOPE: <control>\nREQUIRES: The samples/ folder must exist relative to the SFZ file; put the named sample inside it. Replace every REPLACE_WITH_… filename with a real file path relative to the SFZ.\nTRY: Replace the filename, keep <control> before the region, then play note 60.\nBUILD NOTE: Published support table; not runtime-verified for your Max 9 build."
								]
							},
