									"VALUES: int · -127…127 semitones [P]\nSCOPE: <control>",
									"In <control>, shifts mapped note numbers by this many semitones.",
									"No companion opcode required; use a mapped region and note events. Offsets change key mapping, so compare both note 60 and its shifted note.",
