									"Sample Playback / count   ·   entry 014",
									"VALUES: int · 0…4294967295\nSCOPE: <region> (or inherited from <group>/<master>/<global>)",
									"Sets the total sample plays and forces one_shot; in this engine 0 and 1 both play once.",
									"A finite sample is needed; count forces one_shot, so note-off does not end the repeated playback. Envelope stages are not retriggered for each repeat. Replace every REPLACE_WITH_… filename with a real file path relative to the SFZ.",
									"// count — Sample Playback\n<region>\nsample=REPLACE_WITH_SAMPLE.wav lokey=48 hikey=72 pitch_keycenter=60\nvolume=-18 ampeg_release=0.25 count=3\n",
