									"VALUES: float · 0…100 s [P]\nSCOPE: <region> (or inherited from <group>/<master>/<global>)",
									"Adds a CC-scaled delay before the sample starts.",
									"A note must remain active until the delayed start (unless one_shot behavior is used); releasing too early can suppress the sample. Use MIDI CC 1, matching the numbered suffix; the example supplies its initial value in <control>. Replace every REPLACE_WITH_… filename with a real file path relative to the SFZ.",
									"// delay_ccN — Sample Playback\n<control>\nset_cc1=64\n<region>\nsample=REPLACE_WITH_SAMPLE.wav lokey=48 hikey=72 pitch_keycenter=60\nvolume=-18 ampeg_release=0.25 delay_cc1=0.5\n",
