									"Wavetable Oscillator / oscillator_mod_depth_onccN   ·   entry 500\nVALUES: float · 0…10000 % [P]\nSCOPE: <region> (or inherited from <group>/<master>/<global>)\nREQUIRES: Requires an oscillator source (built-in waveform or sample forced into oscillator mode). Detune needs multiple oscillator instances; modulation depth needs oscillator_mode=1 or 2. Use MIDI CC 1, matching the numbered suffix; the example supplies its initial value in <control>.\nTRY: Load this SFZ into sfizz~; enable audio; play MIDI note 60 at velocity 100, hold for 2 seconds, then release. Sweep MIDI CC 1 while holding a note: midievent 176 1 0 through midievent 176 1 127. set_cc1 is only an initial value and retained CC state can survive reloads.\nBUILD NOTE: Published support table; not runtime-verified for your Max 9 build."
								]
