									"Auxiliary engine syntax / sfizz:filter_gain   ·   entry 507",
									"VALUES: float · −96…96 dB [P] [S]\nSCOPE: <effect> (effect1…effect4 themselves belong in <region>)",
									"In <effect> type=filter, sets shelf/peak gain; this is the implemented spelling behind filter_gain.",
									"Requires <effect> type=filter, bus=fx1, a region effect1 send, and a nonzero fx1tomain return. Parameters after <effect> affect that processor; send opcodes remain under <region>.",
