									"text": "Scope: the 507 existing SFZ records are retained, with 14 sfizz~ object attributes and the defaultpathmode alias added. SFZ support is based on the published table and upstream source, not a runtime-certified inventory for every Max binary. See the sources and build notes at the end.",
