									"text": "Quantizes CC Y changes to LFO N modulation depth for EQ X gain; 0 means continuous.\nDependencies: Requires lfo1_freq>0 and at least one nonzero destination depth such as\nlfo1_pitch; waveform/timing settings alone assign no destination. The CC-shaping\nmodifier also needs lfo1_eq1gain_oncc1; by itself it creates no CC depth. EQ\nfrequency/bandwidth modulation needs a nonzero EQ gain to become audible.",
